{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUG STEPS (Corvo addition)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The buying steps of a rug page: pile height, material, colours, shape, size and shipping, then a summary that keeps the
price in view. A rug shows only the steps its customisation level allows.

THE CUSTOMISATION LEVEL of a rug (rug.customisation) is an entry of the shop's list "Customisation level". It says
with one yes or no each what a client may change: the size (any size typed in, beyond the listed ones), the shape,
the colours, the raw material and the pile height. A rug without a level counts as "size only". The ready-made
versions of a rug (its colourways, its round standard sizes) are not customisation: they stay at every level.

Nothing here reloads the page. The <rug-configurator> element (assets/rug-configurator.js) works the price out in the
browser, with the formula it shares with the price guide of "Tailor your rug" (assets/rug-price-core.js):

  price per m² of the craft level (rug.craft_level > retail_per_m2, without VAT)
  × (1 + the rug's own supplement + the material + the pile height + round corners
       + the small-format or large-format supplement)
  × area × VAT, rounded to the euro
  + the supplement of each custom colour
  × the priority supplement when the faster shipping is chosen

The area is width × length; a round rug is priced on the area of its circle, an oval on the rectangle it fits in.

THE MATERIALS a client chooses from are, when the rug has a choice named "Material", the values of that choice: each
is matched by name with an entry of the shop's list of raw materials, and each variant then carries the exact price
of its material. Otherwise, at a level that allows a choice of material, they are the materials listed on the rug
(rug.materials), the first being the one the rug is shown in. A premium material is never sold online. A material
may carry its own colour card: the colours then come from that card, and from the Open Palette when it has none.

How that price reaches the checkout:

* A standard size with standard shipping and no priced extra is the rug's own variant, at its list price.
* Anything else is charged through the hidden price-step product ("Made-to-measure rug"). The price is rounded to the
  nearest step and the matching variant is looked up through the Storefront API. Design, size, colours and shipping
  travel with the cart line as line item properties.

A rug may have one other choice besides its size: a colourway or a frame. It is offered as a step of its own, and the
rug's own variant is then the one of that size in that colourway. A round standard size ("Ø200 cm") is offered among
the sizes; a rug made to measure is a rectangle.

When the rug has no craft level price, when its variants are not sizes, or when it has more than one other choice, the
theme's own variant picker is shown instead.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* product: the rug (required)
* form_id: the ID of the product form (required)
* block: the "rug_steps" block, for its settings (required). The rules of the price list (VAT, size limits,
  supplements, lead times, the Open Palette) are theme settings, under "Corvo: prices and rules".
* context: "main_product" or "featured_product"
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  # The page that takes requests for what the rug page does not offer ("Another shape?", "Talk to us"). While
  # "Tailor your rug" is switched off in the theme settings ("Corvo: areas of the site"), those links lead to the page of
  # the contact button instead (snippets/corvo-area.liquid).
  assign custom_link = block.settings.custom_link

  capture custom_area_off
    render 'corvo-area', url: custom_link
  endcapture

  if custom_area_off != blank
    assign custom_link = settings.area_tailor_link | default: '/pages/contact'
  endif

  assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign craft = product.metafields.rug.craft_level.value
  assign rate = craft.retail_per_m2.value | default: 0 | times: 100 | round
  assign own_supplement = product.metafields.rug.supplement.value | default: 0 | plus: 0
  assign colour_count = product.metafields.rug.colours.value | default: 0 | plus: 0
  assign colour_refs = product.metafields.rug.colour_refs.value
  assign families = product.metafields.rug.colour_family.value
  assign uid = section.id | append: '-' | append: product.id
  assign step = 0

  if colour_refs.size > colour_count
    assign colour_count = colour_refs.size
  endif

  comment
    What a client may change on this rug. The fields of a level are named "change_…": "size" alone is a word of
    Liquid's own. A rug without a level counts as "size only".
  endcomment

  assign level = product.metafields.rug.customisation.value
  assign level_number = 1
  assign can_size = true
  assign can_shape = false
  assign can_colours = false
  assign can_material = false
  assign can_pile = false

  if level
    assign level_number = level.number.value | default: 0
    assign can_size = level.change_size.value | default: false
    assign can_shape = level.change_shape.value | default: false
    assign can_colours = level.change_colours.value | default: false
    assign can_material = level.change_material.value | default: false
    assign can_pile = level.change_pile.value | default: false
  endif

  comment
    The choices of the rug: its sizes and, at most, one other choice (a colourway, a frame, a material). The sizes
    are the values of the choice named "Size", or of the only choice of the rug.
  endcomment

  assign size_position = 0
  assign choice_option = nil
  assign other_choices = 0

  for option in product.options_with_values
    assign option_name = option.name | downcase | strip

    if option_name == 'size'
      assign size_position = option.position
    else
      assign other_choices = other_choices | plus: 1
      assign choice_option = option
    endif
  endfor

  if size_position == 0 and product.options.size == 1
    assign size_position = 1
    assign other_choices = 0
    assign choice_option = nil
  endif

  assign size_index = size_position | minus: 1
  assign choice_index = -1
  assign choice_is_colour = false
  assign choice_is_material = false
  assign choice_count = 0

  if choice_option
    assign choice_index = choice_option.position | minus: 1
    assign choice_name = choice_option.name | downcase | strip
    assign choice_count = choice_option.values.size

    if choice_name == 'colour' or choice_name == 'color'
      assign choice_is_colour = true
    elsif choice_name == 'material' or choice_name == 'raw material'
      assign choice_is_material = true
    endif
  endif

  comment
    Each size is read once: its shape ("rect" or "round"), its width and its length in centimetres
  endcomment

  assign size_names = ''
  assign size_shapes = ''
  assign size_widths = ''
  assign size_lengths = ''

  if size_position > 0 and other_choices < 2
    for size_value in product.options_with_values[size_index].values
      assign size_name = size_value.name | default: size_value | append: ''

      capture size_read
        render 'rug-size-read', size: size_name
      endcapture

      assign size_parts = size_read | strip | split: '|'
      assign size_names = size_names | append: size_name | append: '§'
      assign size_shapes = size_shapes | append: size_parts[0] | append: '§'
      assign size_widths = size_widths | append: size_parts[1] | append: '§'
      assign size_lengths = size_lengths | append: size_parts[2] | append: '§'
    endfor
  endif

  assign size_names = size_names | split: '§'
  assign size_shapes = size_shapes | split: '§'
  assign size_widths = size_widths | split: '§'
  assign size_lengths = size_lengths | split: '§'
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  The standard sizes: every variant that can be ordered and whose size reads as "width x length" or as "Ø diameter".
  "c" is the place of its colourway or frame among the values of that choice (-1 when the rug has no such choice).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture sizes_json -%}
  {%- if size_names.size > 0 -%}
    {%- for size_variant in product.variants -%}
      {%- liquid
        unless size_variant.available
          continue
        endunless

        assign variant_size = size_variant.options[size_index]
        assign size_at = -1

        for size_name in size_names
          if size_name == variant_size
            assign size_at = forloop.index0
            break
          endif
        endfor

        if size_at < 0
          continue
        endif

        if size_shapes[size_at] == 'other'
          continue
        endif

        assign choice_at = -1

        if choice_option
          assign variant_choice = size_variant.options[choice_index]

          for choice_value in choice_option.values
            assign choice_value_name = choice_value.name | default: choice_value | append: ''

            if choice_value_name == variant_choice
              assign choice_at = forloop.index0
              break
            endif
          endfor
        endif
      -%}

      {"id":{{ size_variant.id }},"w":{{ size_widths[size_at] }},"l":{{ size_lengths[size_at] }},"round":{% if size_shapes[size_at] == 'round' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %},"c":{{ choice_at }},"price":{{ size_variant.price }}}|
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- comment -%}The values of the other choice, each with the picture of its first variant{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture choices_json -%}
  {%- if choice_option -%}
    {%- for choice_value in choice_option.values -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign choice_value_name = choice_value.name | default: choice_value | append: ''
        assign choice_media = nil

        for choice_variant in product.variants
          if choice_variant.options[choice_index] == choice_value_name
            assign choice_media = choice_variant.featured_media
            break
          endif
        endfor
      -%}

      {"name":{{ choice_value_name | json }},"media":{{ choice_media.id | default: 'null' }},"position":{{ choice_media.position | default: 0 }}}|
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- liquid
  assign sizes = sizes_json | strip | split: '|'
  assign selected_width = 0
  assign selected_length = 0
  assign selected_round = false
  assign selected_size_name = variant.options[size_index]

  for size_name in size_names
    if size_name == selected_size_name
      assign selected_width = size_widths[forloop.index0] | plus: 0
      assign selected_length = size_lengths[forloop.index0] | plus: 0

      if size_shapes[forloop.index0] == 'round'
        assign selected_round = true
      endif

      break
    endif
  endfor

  assign selected_choice = -1
  assign selected_choice_name = ''

  if choice_option
    assign selected_choice_name = variant.options[choice_index]

    for choice_value in choice_option.values
      assign choice_value_name = choice_value.name | default: choice_value | append: ''

      if choice_value_name == selected_choice_name
        assign selected_choice = forloop.index0
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  comment
    A choice with one value only (a rug in one colourway) is a fact of the rug: it is not offered as a step
  endcomment

  assign show_choice = false
  assign show_colour_choice = false

  if choice_count > 1
    if choice_is_colour
      assign show_colour_choice = true
    elsif choice_is_material == false
      assign show_choice = true
    endif
  endif

  comment
    Single colours can be swapped only at a level that allows it
  endcomment

  assign show_colour_changes = false

  if block.settings.show_colour_step and colour_count > 0 and can_colours
    assign show_colour_changes = true
  endif

  comment
    The pile heights a client chooses from (rug.pile_options, in millimetres): the first is the one the rug is priced
    in. One height only is a fact of the rug, not a step.
  endcomment

  assign pile_options = product.metafields.rug.pile_options.value
  assign pile_limit = settings.rug_pile_limit | default: 18
  assign pile_percent = settings.rug_pile_percent | default: 0
  assign show_pile = false

  if can_pile and pile_options.size > 1
    assign show_pile = true
  endif

  comment
    The shapes sold online, switched on or off in the theme settings. A rectangle is always one of them.
  endcomment

  assign corners_percent = settings.rug_corners_percent | default: 0
  assign shape_list = 'rect'

  if can_shape and can_size
    if settings.rug_shape_round
      assign shape_list = shape_list | append: ',round'
    endif

    if settings.rug_shape_oval
      assign shape_list = shape_list | append: ',oval'
    endif

    if settings.rug_shape_corners
      assign shape_list = shape_list | append: ',corners'
    endif
  endif

  assign shapes = shape_list | split: ','
  assign show_shape = false

  if shapes.size > 1
    assign show_shape = true
  endif

  assign material_source = ''
  assign material_count = 0
  assign material_names = ''
  assign material_notes = ''
  assign material_states = ''
  assign premium_names = ''
  assign shop_materials = shop.metaobjects.rug_material.values
  assign rug_materials = product.metafields.rug.materials.value
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  The materials, as JSON for the script and as three lists for the buttons: the name, the note ("Included", "+5%")
  and the state of each ("ok"; "premium" when it is not sold online; "unknown" when the shop's list has no material
  of that name, which blocks a made-to-measure price in it).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture materials_json -%}
  {%- if choice_is_material -%}
    {%- assign material_source = 'option' -%}

    {%- for choice_value in choice_option.values -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign choice_value_name = choice_value.name | default: choice_value | append: ''
        assign choice_value_key = choice_value_name | downcase | strip
        assign matched = nil

        for shop_material in shop_materials
          assign shop_material_key = shop_material.name.value | downcase | strip

          if shop_material_key == choice_value_key
            assign matched = shop_material
            break
          endif
        endfor

        assign material_names = material_names | append: choice_value_name | append: '§'
      -%}

      {%- if matched -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign material_notes = material_notes | append: matched.supplement.value | append: '§'

          if matched.group.value == 'Premium'
            assign material_states = material_states | append: 'premium§'
          else
            assign material_states = material_states | append: 'ok§'
            assign material_count = material_count | plus: 1
          endif
        -%}

        {%- render 'rug-material-json', material: matched, card: true -%}¦
      {%- else -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign material_notes = material_notes | append: '-§'
          assign material_states = material_states | append: 'unknown§'
        -%}

        {"handle":"","name":{{ choice_value_name | json }},"note":"","percent":null,"times":100,"premium":false,"palette":[]}¦
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- elsif can_material and rug_materials.size > 0 -%}
    {%- assign material_source = 'list' -%}

    {%- for rug_material in rug_materials -%}
      {%- if rug_material.group.value == 'Premium' -%}
        {%- continue -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- liquid
        assign material_names = material_names | append: rug_material.name.value | append: '§'
        assign material_notes = material_notes | append: rug_material.supplement.value | append: '§'
        assign material_states = material_states | append: 'ok§'
        assign material_count = material_count | plus: 1
      -%}

      {%- render 'rug-material-json', material: rug_material, card: true -%}¦
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- liquid
  assign material_names = material_names | split: '§'
  assign material_notes = material_notes | split: '§'
  assign material_states = material_states | split: '§'
  assign material_selected = 0
  assign show_material = false

  if material_source == 'option'
    assign material_selected = selected_choice

    if choice_count > 1
      assign show_material = true
    endif
  elsif material_source == 'list' and material_count > 1
    assign show_material = true
  endif

  for shop_material in shop_materials
    if shop_material.group.value == 'Premium'
      assign premium_names = premium_names | append: shop_material.name.value | append: '§'
    endif
  endfor

  comment
    What can be chosen and what stays as shown, in words: the page says it in one plain sentence, which a search
    engine or an AI assistant reads without running any script.
  endcomment

  assign can_words = ''
  assign fixed_words = ''

  if level_number < 5
    assign fixed_words = 'rug_page.words.design' | t | append: '§'
  endif

  # In the order of the steps: pile height, material, colours, shape, size
  if show_pile
    assign can_words = 'rug_page.words.pile' | t | append: '§' | prepend: can_words
  else
    assign fixed_words = 'rug_page.words.pile' | t | append: '§' | prepend: fixed_words
  endif

  if show_material
    assign can_words = 'rug_page.words.material' | t | append: '§' | prepend: can_words
  else
    assign fixed_words = 'rug_page.words.material' | t | append: '§' | prepend: fixed_words
  endif

  if show_colour_changes
    assign can_words = 'rug_page.words.colours' | t | append: '§' | prepend: can_words
  elsif show_colour_choice
    assign can_words = 'rug_page.words.colourway' | t | append: '§' | prepend: can_words
  else
    assign fixed_words = 'rug_page.words.colours' | t | append: '§' | prepend: fixed_words
  endif

  if show_shape
    assign can_words = 'rug_page.words.shape' | t | append: '§' | prepend: can_words
  else
    assign fixed_words = 'rug_page.words.shape' | t | append: '§' | prepend: fixed_words
  endif

  if can_size
    assign can_words = 'rug_page.words.size' | t | append: '§' | prepend: can_words
  endif

  assign fixed_count = fixed_words | split: '§' | size
-%}

{%- if rate == 0 or sizes.size == 0 or selected_width == 0 or selected_length == 0 -%}
  {%- render 'variant-picker', product: product, form_id: form_id, context: context, hide_sold_out_variants: false, selector_style: 'block', swatch_selector_style: 'none' -%}
{%- else -%}
  {%- liquid
    # The rules of the price list are theme settings ("Corvo: prices and rules"), shared with the other pages
    assign min_side = settings.rug_min_side | default: 100
    assign max_long = settings.rug_max_long | default: 1200
    assign max_short = settings.rug_max_short | default: 700
    assign size_step = block.settings.size_step | default: 1
    assign vat_percent = settings.rug_vat_percent | default: 23
    assign vat_plus = vat_percent | plus: 100
    assign custom_colour_cents = settings.rug_colour_price | default: 0 | times: vat_plus | round
    assign express_percent = settings.rug_priority_percent | default: 0

    # The two shipping choices are named after the lead times, unless the block gives them a name of its own
    assign standard_label = block.settings.standard_label
    assign express_label = block.settings.express_label

    if standard_label == blank
      assign standard_label = 'rug_page.shipping_in' | t: weeks: settings.rug_lead_weeks
    endif

    if express_label == blank
      assign express_label = 'rug_page.shipping_in' | t: weeks: settings.rug_priority_weeks
    endif

    # Texts may hold markers such as [max_size]: see the "corvo-fill" snippet
    assign size_text_escaped = block.settings.size_text | escape
    assign colour_text_escaped = block.settings.colour_text | escape

    capture size_text
      render 'corvo-fill', text: size_text_escaped
    endcapture

    capture colour_text
      render 'corvo-fill', text: colour_text_escaped
    endcapture

    capture custom_text
      render 'corvo-fill', text: block.settings.custom_colour_text
    endcapture

    capture summary_note
      render 'corvo-fill', text: block.settings.summary_note
    endcapture

    capture large_size
      render 'rug-metres', long: settings.rug_large_long, short: settings.rug_large_short
    endcapture
    assign is_base_currency = false

    if cart.currency.iso_code == shop.currency
      assign is_base_currency = true
    endif

    # The area in m², printed without needless zeros: "3", "8.75", "4.08", and the size in words
    assign selected_shape = 'rect'
    assign selected_size_text = selected_width | append: ' × ' | append: selected_length | append: ' cm'

    if selected_round
      assign selected_shape = 'round'
      assign selected_size_text = 'Ø ' | append: selected_width | append: ' cm'
    endif

    capture area_text
      render 'rug-area', width: selected_width, length: selected_length, shape: selected_shape
    endcapture

    assign total = variant.price
    assign pay_now = total | plus: 1 | divided_by: 2
    assign pay_later = total | minus: pay_now

    capture total_text
      render 'rug-money', amount: total
    endcapture

    capture pay_now_text
      render 'rug-money', amount: pay_now
    endcapture

    capture pay_later_text
      render 'rug-money', amount: pay_later
    endcapture

    capture custom_colour_text
      render 'rug-money', amount: custom_colour_cents
    endcapture

    if settings.currency_code_enabled
      assign money_format = shop.money_with_currency_format
    else
      assign money_format = shop.money_format
    endif

    assign preview = false

    unless theme.role == 'main' or settings.preview_as_live
      assign preview = true
    endunless
  -%}

  {%- comment -%}The price steps of the hidden product, written as "up to this amount: in steps of"{%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture bands_json -%}
    {%- assign bands = block.settings.price_steps | split: ',' -%}

    {%- for band in bands -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign band_parts = band | split: ':'
        assign band_limit = band_parts[0] | strip | plus: 0
        assign band_size = band_parts[1] | strip | plus: 0
      -%}

      {%- if band_limit > 0 and band_size > 0 -%}
        [{{ band_limit }},{{ band_size }}]|
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    The Open Palette: one colour per line, written as "code", "code | name" or "code | name | #hex". The colour card
    of a material is written the same way (see the "rug-palette" snippet).
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture palette_json -%}
    {%- render 'rug-palette', lines: settings.rug_palette -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    Every colour card of the shop's materials, for the swatch of a colour of the design as shown: a reference such as
    "FW224" takes the value of the card that lists it, even on a rug that offers another palette.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture colour_index_json -%}
    {%- for card_material in shop_materials -%}
      {%- if card_material.colours.value != blank -%}
        {%- render 'rug-palette', lines: card_material.colours.value -%}¦
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- comment -%}The sentence that says what can be chosen on this rug and what stays as shown{%- endcomment -%}
  {%- capture scope_text -%}
    {%- if can_words == blank -%}
      {{- 'rug_page.scope_none' | t -}}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- capture can_list -%}{%- render 'corvo-and', items: can_words -%}{%- endcapture -%}
      {{- 'rug_page.scope_can' | t: list: can_list -}}

      {%- if fixed_words != blank %}
        {% capture fixed_list -%}{%- render 'corvo-and', items: fixed_words -%}{%- endcapture -%}

        {%- if fixed_count == 1 -%}
          {{- 'rug_page.scope_fixed_one' | t: list: fixed_list | capitalize -}}
        {%- else -%}
          {{- 'rug_page.scope_fixed_other' | t: list: fixed_list | capitalize -}}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- capture colours_json -%}
    {%- for i in (1..colour_count) -%}
      {%- unless show_colour_changes -%}{%- break -%}{%- endunless -%}
      {%- assign colour_ref = colour_refs[forloop.index0] -%}
      {"ref":{{ colour_ref | default: '' | json }}}|
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  <rug-configurator class="rug-steps" form="{{ form_id }}" data-rug-steps>
    <script type="application/json" data-rug-config>
      {
        "uid": {{ uid | json }},
        "handle": {{ product.handle | json }},
        "title": {{ product.title | json }},
        "level": {{ level_number | default: 0 }},
        "typed": {% if can_size %}true{% else %}false{% endif %},
        "selected": { "w": {{ selected_width | default: 0 }}, "l": {{ selected_length | default: 0 }} },
        "shapes": {% if show_shape %}{{ shapes | json }}{% else %}null{% endif %},
        "corners": {{ corners_percent | default: 0 }},
        "materials": {% if material_source != '' %}{ "source": {{ material_source | json }}, "step": {% if show_material %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}, "selected": {{ material_selected | default: 0 }}, "values": [{{ materials_json | strip | split: '¦' | join: ',' }}] }{% else %}null{% endif %},
        "pile": {% if show_pile %}{ "options": [{{ pile_options | join: ',' }}], "limit": {{ pile_limit | default: 18 }}, "percent": {{ pile_percent | default: 0 }} }{% else %}null{% endif %},
        "rate": {{ rate }},
        "supplement": {{ own_supplement }},
        "vat": {{ vat_percent }},
        "small": { "below": {{ settings.rug_small_area | default: 3 }}, "percent": {{ settings.rug_small_percent | default: 0 }} },
        "large": { "long": {{ settings.rug_large_long | default: 900 }}, "short": {{ settings.rug_large_short | default: 400 }}, "percent": {{ settings.rug_large_percent | default: 0 }} },
        "limits": { "min": {{ min_side }}, "long": {{ max_long }}, "short": {{ max_short }}, "step": {{ size_step }} },
        "sizes": [{{ sizes | join: ',' }}],
        "round": {{ selected_round }},
        "choice": {% if choice_option %}{ "name": {{ choice_option.name | json }}, "colour": {{ choice_is_colour }}, "selected": {{ selected_choice }}, "values": [{{ choices_json | strip | split: '|' | join: ',' }}] }{% else %}null{% endif %},
        "colours": [{{ colours_json | strip | split: '|' | join: ',' }}],
        "palette": [{{ palette_json | strip }}],
        "colourIndex": [{{ colour_index_json | strip | split: '¦' | join: ',' }}],
        "customColour": {{ custom_colour_cents }},
        "expressPercent": {{ express_percent }},
        "steps": {
          "handle": {{ block.settings.price_product | default: 'made-to-measure-rug' | json }},
          "option": "Reference",
          "min": {{ block.settings.price_steps_min | default: 500 }},
          "bands": [{{ bands_json | strip | split: '|' | join: ',' }}]
        },
        "country": {{ localization.country.iso_code | json }},
        "baseCurrency": {{ is_base_currency | json }},
        "moneyFormat": {{ money_format | json }},
        "preview": {{ preview | json }},
        "strings": {
          "area": {{ 'rug_page.area' | t: area: '[area]' | json }},
          "about": {{ 'rug_page.about' | t: size: '[size]' | json }},
          "round": {{ 'rug_page.round' | t: size: '[size]' | json }},
          "errorNumber": {{ 'rug_page.error_number' | t | json }},
          "errorMin": {{ 'rug_page.error_min' | t: min: min_side | json }},
          "errorLong": {{ 'rug_page.error_long' | t: max: max_long | json }},
          "errorShort": {{ 'rug_page.error_short' | t: max: max_short | json }},
          "errorStep": {{ 'rug_page.error_step' | t: step: size_step | json }},
          "errorDiameter": {{ 'rug_page.error_diameter' | t | json }},
          "errorDiameterMin": {{ 'rug_page.error_diameter_min' | t: min: min_side | json }},
          "errorDiameterMax": {{ 'rug_page.error_diameter_max' | t: max: max_short | json }},
          "cardTitle": {{ 'rug_page.card_title' | t: material: '[material]' | json }},
          "asShown": {{ 'rug_page.as_shown' | t | json }},
          "change": {{ 'rug_page.change' | t | json }},
          "close": {{ 'rug_page.done' | t | json }},
          "keep": {{ 'rug_page.keep_original' | t | json }},
          "replaces": {{ 'rug_page.replaces' | t: reference: '[reference]' | json }},
          "custom": {{ 'rug_page.custom' | t | json }},
          "changedOne": {{ 'rug_page.changed_one' | t | json }},
          "changedOther": {{ 'rug_page.changed_other' | t: count: '[count]' | json }},
          "paletteTitle": {{ block.settings.palette_title | json }},
          "paletteNote": {{ block.settings.palette_note | json }},
          "palettePreview": {{ 'rug_page.palette_preview' | t | json }},
          "customTitle": {{ block.settings.custom_colour_title | json }},
          "customText": {{ custom_text | strip | json }},
          "customPlaceholder": {{ 'rug_page.custom_placeholder' | t | json }},
          "customPrice": {{ custom_colour_text | strip | json }},
          "perColour": {{ 'rug_page.per_colour' | t: amount: '[amount]' | json }},
          "supplementApplies": {{ 'rug_page.supplement_applies' | t | json }},
          "small": {{ 'rug_page.small_format' | t: area: settings.rug_small_area, percent: settings.rug_small_percent | json }},
          "large": {{ 'rug_page.large_format' | t: size: large_size, percent: settings.rug_large_percent | json }},
          "standard": {{ standard_label | json }},
          "express": {{ express_label | json }},
          "included": {{ 'rug_page.included' | t | json }},
          "surcharge": {{ 'rug_page.surcharge' | t: amount: '[amount]' | json }},
          "percent": {{ 'rug_page.percent_more' | t: percent: express_percent | json }},
          "onRequest": {{ 'rug_page.on_request' | t | json }},
          "failed": {{ 'rug_page.price_failed' | t | json }},
          "width": {{ 'rug_page.width' | t | json }},
          "diameter": {{ 'rug_page.diameter' | t | json }},
          "oval": {{ 'rug_page.oval_note' | t | json }},
          "millimetres": {{ 'rug_page.millimetres' | t: height: '[height]' | json }},
          "shapeNames": { "rect": {{ 'rug_page.shapes.rect' | t | json }}, "round": {{ 'rug_page.shapes.round' | t | json }}, "oval": {{ 'rug_page.shapes.oval' | t | json }}, "corners": {{ 'rug_page.shapes.corners' | t | json }} },
          "propertyMaterial": {{ 'rug_page.material' | t | json }},
          "propertyPile": {{ 'rug_page.pile_height' | t | json }},
          "propertyShape": {{ 'rug_page.shape' | t | json }},
          "propertyDesign": {{ 'rug_page.design' | t | json }},
          "propertySize": {{ 'rug_page.size' | t | json }},
          "propertyColours": {{ 'rug_page.colours' | t | json }},
          "propertyColour": {{ 'rug_page.colour_number' | t: number: '[number]' | json }},
          "propertyShipping": {{ 'rug_page.shipping' | t | json }}
        }
      }
    </script>

    {%- comment -%}What can be chosen on this rug, in one plain sentence{%- endcomment -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      A rug made in a choice of materials but at one pile height points to the fully custom rug, where the pile
      height is a choice too (the block names it by its handle)
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign full_custom = nil

      if can_material and show_pile == false and block.settings.full_custom_handle != blank
        assign full_custom = all_products[block.settings.full_custom_handle]

        if full_custom.id == blank or full_custom.id == product.id
          assign full_custom = nil
        endif

        # The fully custom rug belongs to "Tailor your rug": no link to it while that area is switched off
        capture full_custom_off
          render 'corvo-area', url: full_custom.url
        endcapture

        if full_custom_off != blank
          assign full_custom = nil
        endif
      endif
    -%}

    <p class="rug-steps__scope text-sm text-subdued" data-rug-scope>
      {{- scope_text | strip -}}

      {%- if full_custom %}
        {{ 'rug_page.full_custom' | t }} <a href="{{ full_custom.url }}" class="link">{{ full_custom.title | escape }}</a>.
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>

    {%- comment -%}
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    PILE HEIGHT
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {%- endcomment -%}

    {%- if show_pile -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign step = step | plus: 1
        assign pile_legend_id = 'rug-pile-' | append: uid
      -%}

      <div class="rug-step" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{ pile_legend_id }}">
        <p class="rug-step__legend" id="{{ pile_legend_id }}">
          <span class="rug-step__number smallcaps text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.step' | t: number: step }}</span>
          <span class="rug-step__title h6">{{ 'rug_page.pile_height' | t }}</span>
        </p>

        <div class="rug-options" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'rug_page.pile_height' | t | escape }}">
          {%- for pile_option in pile_options -%}
            <button type="button" class="rug-option" data-rug-pile="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-pressed="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
              <span class="rug-option__name">{{ 'rug_page.millimetres' | t: height: pile_option }}</span>

              <span class="rug-option__reference text-subdued">
                {%- if pile_option > pile_limit and pile_percent > 0 -%}
                  {{- 'rug_page.percent_more' | t: percent: pile_percent -}}
                {%- else -%}
                  {{- 'rug_page.included' | t -}}
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    MATERIAL
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {%- endcomment -%}

    {%- if show_material -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign step = step | plus: 1
        assign material_legend_id = 'rug-material-' | append: uid
      -%}

      <div class="rug-step" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{ material_legend_id }}">
        <p class="rug-step__legend" id="{{ material_legend_id }}">
          <span class="rug-step__number smallcaps text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.step' | t: number: step }}</span>
          <span class="rug-step__title h6">{{ 'rug_page.material' | t }}</span>
        </p>

        <div class="rug-options" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'rug_page.material' | t | escape }}">
          {%- for material_name in material_names -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign material_state = material_states[forloop.index0]
              assign material_note = material_notes[forloop.index0]

              if material_state == 'premium'
                continue
              endif
            -%}

            <button type="button" class="rug-option" data-rug-material="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-pressed="{% if forloop.index0 == material_selected %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
              <span class="rug-option__name">{{ material_name | escape }}</span>

              {%- if material_state == 'ok' and material_note != blank -%}
                <span class="rug-option__reference text-subdued">{{ material_note | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        {%- if premium_names != blank -%}
          <p class="rug-step__more text-sm text-subdued">
            {%- capture premium_list -%}{%- render 'corvo-and', items: premium_names -%}{%- endcapture -%}
            {{- 'rug_page.premium_note' | t: materials: premium_list -}}

            {%- if custom_link != blank and block.settings.contact_link_text != blank %}
              <a href="{{ custom_link }}" class="link">{{ block.settings.contact_link_text | escape }}</a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    COLOURS
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {%- endcomment -%}

    {%- comment -%}The values of the other choice, as buttons: a name and, under it, its colour references{%- endcomment -%}
    {%- capture choice_buttons -%}
      {%- if choice_count > 1 -%}
        <div class="rug-options" role="group" aria-label="{{ choice_option.name | escape }}">
          {%- for choice_value in choice_option.values -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign choice_value_name = choice_value.name | default: choice_value | append: ''
              assign choice_parts = choice_value_name | split: ' ('
              assign choice_label = choice_parts | first
              assign choice_reference = ''

              if choice_parts.size > 1
                assign choice_reference = choice_parts | last | remove: ')' | replace: '/', ' · '
              endif
            -%}

            <button type="button" class="rug-option" data-rug-choice="{{ forloop.index0 }}" aria-pressed="{% if forloop.index0 == selected_choice %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}">
              <span class="rug-option__name">{{ choice_label | escape }}</span>

              {%- if choice_reference != blank -%}
                <span class="rug-option__reference text-subdued">{{ choice_reference | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endcapture -%}

    {%- if show_choice -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign step = step | plus: 1
        assign choice_legend_id = 'rug-choice-' | append: uid
      -%}

      <div class="rug-step" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{ choice_legend_id }}">
        <p class="rug-step__legend" id="{{ choice_legend_id }}">
          <span class="rug-step__number smallcaps text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.step' | t: number: step }}</span>
          <span class="rug-step__title h6">{{ choice_option.name | escape }}</span>
        </p>

        {{- choice_buttons -}}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if show_colour_choice or show_colour_changes -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign step = step | plus: 1
        assign colour_legend_id = 'rug-colours-' | append: uid
        assign family_note = families | join: ', '
      -%}

      <div class="rug-step" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{ colour_legend_id }}">
        <p class="rug-step__legend" id="{{ colour_legend_id }}">
          <span class="rug-step__number smallcaps text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.step' | t: number: step }}</span>
          <span class="rug-step__title h6">{{ 'rug_page.colours' | t }}</span>

          {%- if family_note != blank and show_colour_choice == false -%}
            <span class="rug-step__aside text-sm text-subdued">{{ family_note | escape }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>

        {%- if show_colour_choice -%}
          {{- choice_buttons -}}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if show_colour_changes -%}
          <ul class="rug-colours unstyled-list" role="list">
            {%- for i in (1..colour_count) -%}
              {%- assign colour_ref = colour_refs[forloop.index0] -%}

              <li class="rug-colour" data-rug-colour="{{ forloop.index0 }}">
                <div class="rug-colour__row">
                  <span class="rug-colour__swatch" data-rug-colour-swatch aria-hidden="true"></span>

                  <span class="rug-colour__text">
                    <span class="rug-colour__name">{{ 'rug_page.colour_number' | t: number: i }}</span>

                    <span class="rug-colour__value text-sm text-subdued" data-rug-colour-value>
                      {%- if colour_ref != blank -%}
                        {{- colour_ref | escape }} · {{ 'rug_page.as_shown' | t | downcase -}}
                      {%- else -%}
                        {{- 'rug_page.as_shown' | t -}}
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </span>
                  </span>

                  <button type="button" class="rug-colour__change link text-sm" data-rug-colour-change aria-expanded="false">{{ 'rug_page.change' | t }}</button>
                </div>
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>

          {%- if block.settings.colour_text != blank -%}
            <p class="rug-step__more text-sm text-subdued">{{ colour_text | strip }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    SHAPE
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {%- endcomment -%}

    {%- if show_shape -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign step = step | plus: 1
        assign shape_legend_id = 'rug-shape-' | append: uid
      -%}

      <div class="rug-step" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{ shape_legend_id }}">
        <p class="rug-step__legend" id="{{ shape_legend_id }}">
          <span class="rug-step__number smallcaps text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.step' | t: number: step }}</span>
          <span class="rug-step__title h6">{{ 'rug_page.shape' | t }}</span>
        </p>

        <div class="rug-options" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'rug_page.shape' | t | escape }}">
          {%- for shape in shapes -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign shape_key = 'rug_page.shapes.' | append: shape
              assign shape_pressed = false

              if shape == selected_shape
                assign shape_pressed = true
              endif
            -%}

            <button type="button" class="rug-option" data-rug-shape="{{ shape }}" aria-pressed="{{ shape_pressed }}">
              <span class="rug-option__name">{{ shape_key | t }}</span>

              {%- if shape == 'corners' and corners_percent > 0 -%}
                <span class="rug-option__reference text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.percent_more' | t: percent: corners_percent }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>

        {%- if custom_link != blank and block.settings.size_link_text != blank -%}
          <p class="rug-step__more text-sm text-subdued">
            <a href="{{ custom_link }}" class="link">{{ block.settings.size_link_text | escape }}</a>
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    SIZE
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {%- endcomment -%}

    {%- assign step = step | plus: 1 -%}

    <fieldset class="rug-step">
      <legend class="rug-step__legend">
        <span class="rug-step__number smallcaps text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.step' | t: number: step }}</span>
        <span class="rug-step__title h6">{{ 'rug_page.size' | t }}</span>
      </legend>

      <div class="rug-sizes" role="group" aria-label="{{ 'rug_page.standard_sizes' | t | escape }}">
        {%- for size_name in size_names -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign size_shape = size_shapes[forloop.index0]
            assign size_width = size_widths[forloop.index0] | plus: 0
            assign size_length = size_lengths[forloop.index0] | plus: 0
            assign size_is_round = false

            if size_shape == 'other'
              continue
            endif

            if size_shape == 'round'
              assign size_is_round = true
            endif

            comment
              A size is offered when one of its variants can be ordered
            endcomment

            assign size_needle = '"w":' | append: size_width | append: ',"l":' | append: size_length | append: ',"round":' | append: size_is_round | append: ','

            unless sizes_json contains size_needle
              continue
            endunless

            assign size_pressed = false

            if size_width == selected_width and size_length == selected_length and size_is_round == selected_round
              assign size_pressed = true
            endif
          -%}

          {%- if size_is_round -%}
            <button type="button" class="rug-size" data-rug-size data-round data-width="{{ size_width }}" data-length="{{ size_length }}" aria-label="{{ 'rug_page.round' | t: size: size_width | escape }}" aria-pressed="{{ size_pressed }}">
              Ø&nbsp;{{ size_width -}}
            </button>
          {%- else -%}
            <button type="button" class="rug-size" data-rug-size data-width="{{ size_width }}" data-length="{{ size_length }}" aria-pressed="{{ size_pressed }}">
              {{- size_width }}&nbsp;×&nbsp;{{ size_length -}}
            </button>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Any size, typed in: only at a level that allows it. With a choice of shape, a round rug asks for one number,
        its diameter: the second field is then put away by the script.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if can_size -%}
        <div class="rug-dimensions">
          <label class="rug-field" for="rug-width-{{ uid }}">
            <span class="rug-field__label text-sm text-subdued" data-rug-width-label>{{ 'rug_page.width' | t }}</span>

            <span class="rug-field__control">
              <input class="rug-field__input" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" maxlength="4" autocomplete="off" id="rug-width-{{ uid }}" value="{{ selected_width }}" data-rug-width aria-describedby="rug-size-error-{{ uid }}">
              <span class="rug-field__unit text-subdued" aria-hidden="true">cm</span>
            </span>
          </label>

          <span class="rug-dimensions__times text-subdued" aria-hidden="true" data-rug-length-part>×</span>

          <label class="rug-field" for="rug-length-{{ uid }}" data-rug-length-part>
            <span class="rug-field__label text-sm text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.length' | t }}</span>

            <span class="rug-field__control">
              <input class="rug-field__input" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" maxlength="4" autocomplete="off" id="rug-length-{{ uid }}" value="{{ selected_length }}" data-rug-length aria-describedby="rug-size-error-{{ uid }}">
              <span class="rug-field__unit text-subdued" aria-hidden="true">cm</span>
            </span>
          </label>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <p class="rug-step__error text-sm" id="rug-size-error-{{ uid }}" data-rug-size-error role="alert" hidden></p>
      <p class="rug-step__more text-sm" data-rug-size-info>{% if selected_round %}{{ selected_size_text }} · {% endif %}{{ 'rug_page.area' | t: area: area_text }}</p>
      <p class="rug-step__note text-sm" data-rug-size-note hidden></p>

      {%- if can_size and block.settings.size_text != blank -%}
        <p class="rug-step__more text-sm text-subdued">
          {{- size_text | strip -}}

          {%- if show_shape == false and custom_link != blank and block.settings.size_link_text != blank %}
            <a href="{{ custom_link }}" class="link">{{ block.settings.size_link_text | escape }}</a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </fieldset>

    {%- comment -%}
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    SHIPPING
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {%- endcomment -%}

    {%- if block.settings.show_shipping_step and express_percent > 0 -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign step = step | plus: 1
        assign shipping_name = 'rug-shipping-' | append: uid
      -%}

      <fieldset class="rug-step">
        <legend class="rug-step__legend">
          <span class="rug-step__number smallcaps text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.step' | t: number: step }}</span>
          <span class="rug-step__title h6">{{ 'rug_page.shipping' | t }}</span>
        </legend>

        <div class="rug-step__choices">
          <input class="sr-only" type="radio" id="{{ shipping_name }}-standard" name="{{ shipping_name }}" value="standard" checked autocomplete="off" data-rug-shipping>

          <label class="rug-choice" for="{{ shipping_name }}-standard">
            <span class="rug-choice__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>

            <span class="rug-choice__text rug-choice__text--stacked">
              <span class="rug-choice__title">{{ standard_label | escape }}</span>

              {%- if block.settings.standard_note != blank -%}
                <span class="rug-choice__note text-subdued">{{ block.settings.standard_note | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>

            <span class="rug-choice__price">{{ 'rug_page.included' | t }}</span>
          </label>

          <input class="sr-only" type="radio" id="{{ shipping_name }}-express" name="{{ shipping_name }}" value="express" autocomplete="off" data-rug-shipping>

          <label class="rug-choice" for="{{ shipping_name }}-express">
            <span class="rug-choice__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>

            <span class="rug-choice__text rug-choice__text--stacked">
              <span class="rug-choice__title">{{ express_label | escape }}</span>

              {%- if block.settings.express_note != blank -%}
                <span class="rug-choice__note text-subdued">{{ block.settings.express_note | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>

            <span class="rug-choice__price" data-rug-express-extra>{{ 'rug_page.percent_more' | t: percent: express_percent }}</span>
          </label>
        </div>
      </fieldset>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    SUMMARY
    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {%- endcomment -%}

    <div class="rug-summary" data-rug-summary>
      <p class="rug-summary__title smallcaps text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.your_rug' | t }}</p>

      <dl class="rug-summary__list">
        <div>
          <dt>{{ 'rug_page.design' | t }}</dt>
          <dd>{{ product.title | escape }}</dd>
        </div>

        {%- if show_material -%}
          <div>
            <dt>{{ 'rug_page.material' | t }}</dt>
            <dd data-rug-summary-material>{{ material_names[material_selected] | escape }}</dd>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if show_pile -%}
          <div>
            <dt>{{ 'rug_page.pile_height' | t }}</dt>
            <dd data-rug-summary-pile>{{ 'rug_page.millimetres' | t: height: pile_options.first }}</dd>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if show_shape -%}
          {%- assign selected_shape_key = 'rug_page.shapes.' | append: selected_shape -%}

          <div>
            <dt>{{ 'rug_page.shape' | t }}</dt>
            <dd data-rug-summary-shape>{{ selected_shape_key | t }}</dd>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div>
          <dt>{{ 'rug_page.size' | t }}</dt>
          <dd data-rug-summary-size>{{ selected_size_text }} · {{ 'rug_page.area' | t: area: area_text }}</dd>
        </div>

        <div data-rug-summary-supplement-row hidden>
          <dt>{{ 'rug_page.supplement' | t }}</dt>
          <dd data-rug-summary-supplement></dd>
        </div>

        {%- if choice_option and choice_is_colour == false and choice_is_material == false -%}
          <div>
            <dt>{{ choice_option.name | escape }}</dt>
            <dd data-rug-summary-choice>{{ selected_choice_name | escape }}</dd>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if show_colour_changes or choice_is_colour -%}
          <div>
            <dt>{{ 'rug_page.colours' | t }}</dt>
            <dd data-rug-summary-colours>{% if choice_is_colour %}{{ selected_choice_name | escape }}{% else %}{{ 'rug_page.as_shown' | t }}{% endif %}</dd>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if block.settings.show_shipping_step and express_percent > 0 -%}
          <div>
            <dt>{{ 'rug_page.shipping' | t }}</dt>
            {%- comment -%}"Shipping in 5 weeks" under the word "Shipping" reads "In 5 weeks"{%- endcomment -%}
            {%- assign shipping_word = 'rug_page.shipping' | t -%}
            <dd data-rug-summary-shipping>{{ standard_label | remove_first: shipping_word | strip | capitalize | escape }}</dd>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </dl>

      <div class="rug-summary__total">
        <span class="h6">{{ 'rug_page.total' | t }}</span>

        <span class="rug-summary__amount">
          <span class="h4" data-rug-total aria-live="polite">{{ total_text | strip }}</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-subdued">{{ 'rug_page.vat_included' | t }}</span>
        </span>
      </div>

      {%- if block.settings.show_payment_split -%}
        <dl class="rug-summary__split text-sm">
          <div>
            <dt>{{ 'rug_page.pay_now' | t }}</dt>
            <dd data-rug-pay-now>{{ pay_now_text | strip }}</dd>
          </div>

          <div>
            <dt>{{ 'rug_page.pay_later' | t }}</dt>
            <dd data-rug-pay-later>{{ pay_later_text | strip }}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      {%- endif -%}

      <p class="rug-summary__message text-sm" data-rug-message role="status" hidden>
        <span data-rug-message-text></span>

        {%- if custom_link != blank and block.settings.contact_link_text != blank %}
          <a href="{{ custom_link }}" class="link">{{ block.settings.contact_link_text | escape }}</a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>

      {%- if block.settings.summary_note != blank -%}
        <div class="rug-summary__note prose text-sm text-subdued">
          {{- summary_note | strip -}}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </rug-configurator>

  {%- comment -%}The formula is shared with the price guide of "Tailor your rug" (assets/rug-price-core.js){%- endcomment -%}
  <script src="{{ 'rug-price-core.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
  <script src="{{ 'rug-configurator.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{%- endif -%}
